abstract: >-
  Moment and prime-trace formulations of the Riemann hypothesis, spectral
  exclusions including a constant-coefficient Morse family, and a separately
  stated TCGS–SEQUENTION source-to-readout realization problem. The Riemann
  hypothesis is not proved.
keywords:
  - Riemann hypothesis
  - moment problem
  - spectral geometry
  - Fredholm determinants
  - Morse potential
  - TCGS-SEQUENTION
